        "original_id": "88b49582-1c26-5e85-8838-eb80cd95918d",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Eric Radomski\n- Products: Ultimate Spider-Man, Avengers Assemble, Hulk and the Agents of S.M.A.S.H., Guardians of the Galaxy\n- Organizations: Disney XD\n- Concepts: The Avengers (2012 film)\n\nFacts:\n- Eric Radomski is associated with the animated series Ultimate Spider-Man, Avengers Assemble, Hulk and the Agents of S.M.A.S.H., and Guardians of the Galaxy.\n- The 2012 film The Avengers was successful enough that Avengers Assemble was designed to capitalize on it.\n- Avengers Assemble premiered on Disney XD on May 26, 2013.\n- Avengers Assemble succeeded a prior series on Disney XD.",
